# FinanceGuard environment variables
#
# Cloud sync is OPTIONAL. Leave everything blank to run FinanceGuard 100% locally
# — the app works with no account and nothing breaks if this file is missing.
#
# To enable zero-knowledge cloud sync:
#   1. Create a free Supabase project (https://supabase.com).
#   2. Run the SQL migrations in supabase/migrations/ (0001_vault.sql, 0002_active_session.sql).
#   3. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values below.
#   4. Restart the dev server / rebuild (these are compiled into the client at build time).
#
# The anon key is public by design: security comes from client-side encryption
# (AES-256-GCM) + Supabase Row Level Security, never from keeping this key secret.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Market data (investments section), optional ------------------------------
# Which source to use for stock/ETF quotes. Crypto always uses CoinGecko and
# exchange rates always come from Frankfurter (ECB) — neither needs a key.
# Instrument search always uses Twelve Data's keyless endpoint, so the picker
# works even with none of this configured.
#
#   yahoo      (default) free, no key, covers European UCITS ETFs. Sends no CORS
#              headers, so it only works in the desktop and mobile builds, which
#              route the request outside the WebView. In a plain browser it is
#              blocked and you fall back to manual prices.
#   twelvedata needs a free key (https://twelvedata.com). Works in the browser
#              too, but the free plan only covers US markets.
#   none       manual prices only.
#
# WARNING: NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are compiled into the bundle, so anyone with the
# binary can read this key. Use a dedicated free key, never a paid one. You can
# also leave it blank and set the key at runtime in Settings, where it is stored
# encrypted in the vault and takes precedence over this value.

NEXT_PUBLIC_MARKET_PROVIDER=
NEXT_PUBLIC_MARKET_API_KEY=

# --- Desktop (Electron) only, optional ---------------------------------------
# Override where the encrypted bundle and per-device state are stored.
# FG_DATA_DIR=
# FG_LOCAL_DIR=
